{"chapter": "spaces-groupoids", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "044O", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S'$", "MATH_0002": "$S$", "MATH_0003": "$r : S' \\to R$", "MATH_0004": "$S$", "MATH_0005": "$r \\in R(S')$", "MATH_0006": "$s \\circ r, t \\circ r \\in U(S')$", "MATH_0007": "$2$", "MATH_0008": "$\\alpha_p : \\pi_p \\circ s \\to \\pi_p \\circ t$", "MATH_0009": "$\\pi_p : \\mathcal{S}_U \\to [U/_{\\!p}R]$", "MATH_0010": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\n\\mathcal{S}_R \\ar[r]_s \\ar[d]^t & \\mathcal{S}_U \\ar[d]^{\\pi_p} \\\\\n\\mathcal{S}_U \\ar[r]^-{\\pi_p} & [U/_{\\!p}R]\n}\n$$", "MATH_0011": "$2$", "MATH_0012": "$2$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-quotient-stack-arrows}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:bd16b663ceab71b1a836ffb3f16db7433ffb813f5be727369a9e0b95b1b9868a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:bdbb6e6bea2e699a60e852f35025f1cf08abe5221d43449693e9325963c17ba9", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme over <MATH_0002>. Let <MATH_0003> be a morphism over <MATH_0004>.\nThen <MATH_0005> is an isomorphism between the objects\n<MATH_0006>. Moreover, this construction is\ncompatible with pullbacks. This gives a canonical\n<MATH_0007>-morphism <MATH_0008>\nwhere <MATH_0009> is as in the\nproof of\nLemma <REF_0001>. Thus even the diagram\n<MATH_0010>\nis <MATH_0011>-commutative. Thus a fortiori the diagram\nof the lemma is <MATH_0012>-commutative.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:cbf5d00b0fc757c669afed95c1cdf8f1cef23be51e10bbe7874bc5eb6b1350df", "unit_id": "tag:044S:proof"}
